<section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">COOK · SHARE · MAKE IT YOURS</p><h1>What’s cooking?</h1><p>Find a favorite, then remix it into something unmistakably yours.</p>
<form class="search" method="get"><input type="search" name="q" value="<?=e($query)?>" placeholder="Search recipes or ingredients…" autofocus><button>Search</button><?php if($mine):?><input type="hidden" name="mine" value="1"><?php endif?></form></section>
